Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.06,0:00:03.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, we're shining, running, forever!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.08,0:00:06.74,Default,,0,0,0,,The sea is calling out, so ride the waves!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.90,0:00:09.56,Default,,0,0,0,,We're all together as one,\Nso let's sail in the sun!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.64,0:00:14.70,Default,,0,0,0,,All our dreams are never-ending, so\Nlet's wake up, wake up, wake up, wake up!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.94,0:00:17.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Heartbeat, we will be one! Go ahead!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.50,0:00:26.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Even though our hearts have\Ntraveled different paths.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.62,0:00:28.18,Default,,0,0,0,,We are best friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.26,0:00:30.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Our freedom is our only compass.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.10,0:00:34.20,Default,,0,0,0,,That's pointing us along the\Nmany roads that come together.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.28,0:00:37.54,Default,,0,0,0,,We will keep on running forward every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.62,0:00:38.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Go east, go west.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.98,0:00:41.68,Default,,0,0,0,,As long as we keep looking to the horizon.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.76,0:00:44.44,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll see everything all crystal clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.60,0:00:50.30,Default,,0,0,0,,We're all so thrilled that we\Ncan't wait until the dawn arrives.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.90,0:00:54.52,Default,,0,0,0,,So we'll just bring the\Nsun ourselves to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.60,0:00:58.74,Default,,0,0,0,,If the winds blow, it's waiting\Nwhere we should be going. Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.64,0:01:02.20,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right, we're\Nshining, running forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.28,0:01:05.26,Default,,0,0,0,,All of our dreams will\Nmerge into one piece.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.34,0:01:07.98,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter where we go,\Nwe'll be fine and free.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.06,0:01:10.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Cause all our treasure is our strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.78,0:01:13.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, we're shining, running forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.36,0:01:16.22,Default,,0,0,0,,The sea is coming out, so ride away!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.42,0:01:19.16,Default,,0,0,0,,We're all together as well, so\Nlet's just stay with us, son!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.24,0:01:24.24,Default,,0,0,0,,All our dreams are never ending, so\Nlet's wake up, wake up, wake up, wake up!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.48,0:01:26.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Heartbeat, we will be one, go hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.40,0:01:32.81,Default,,0,0,0,,My darkness will swallow the\Nworld, just you wait and see!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.38,0:01:35.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You think I'll lose to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.36,0:01:37.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna be king of the pirates!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.84,0:01:40.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Roger's treasure belongs to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.44,0:01:47.62,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll ride non-stop and travel farther.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.70,0:01:52.28,Default,,0,0,0,,than we've ever gone And then tomorrow we
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.36,0:01:55.36,Default,,0,0,0,,will find suspense And then commence to
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.44,0:02:00.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Live out another day so intense.\NThat's right, we're shining,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.28,0:02:05.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Running forever. Let's go along\Nwith curiosity. Our feelings lead.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.32,0:02:10.94,Default,,0,0,0,,the way straight to a brand new day Into\Nanother adventure Come on, we're shining,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.24,0:02:16.72,Default,,0,0,0,,running forever Open the map inside your\Nheart and see No matter where we end up,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.86,0:02:21.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Our mods will never give up. There's a\Nfire in our dreams and you can never,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.86,0:02:25.86,Default,,0,0,0,,never, never, never stop it\NWe will be one, go ahead!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.82,0:02:31.62,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a dream come true!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.04,0:02:35.22,Default,,0,0,0,,This is sure to be the finest\Nbattle you've ever seen!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.90,0:02:40.80,Default,,0,0,0,,The four winners from the first round\Nwill be facing each other as well as Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.88,0:02:41.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Diamante!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.79,0:02:44.46,Default,,0,0,0,,These brave battlers, seeking strength,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.72,0:02:47.46,Default,,0,0,0,,shall fight it when they\Nlay claim to the prize.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.54,0:02:52.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Alone ye a Devil Fruit, the strongest of\Nthe three types, the flame flame fruit!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.14,0:02:54.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Ha ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.46,0:02:56.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I can almost taste it!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.54,0:03:02.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop the match now!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.26,0:03:05.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Take Rebecca out of the ring!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.98,0:03:08.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Redo the block D match! Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.66,0:03:10.84,Default,,0,0,0,,A last-minute objection to the fight?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.68,0:03:14.74,Default,,0,0,0,,whatever the hell happened\Nback there I don't accept
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.82,0:03:18.56,Default,,0,0,0,,it now fight me there's\Nno way all of us lost to
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.64,0:03:21.12,Default,,0,0,0,,a rotten little shrimp\Nlike you time for us to set
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.20,0:03:24.56,Default,,0,0,0,,the record straight hell\Nyeah you guys kick your ass
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.22,0:03:33.86,Default,,0,0,0,,out of the way buddy don't\Nbe such sore losers gentlemen
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.94,0:03:38.00,Default,,0,0,0,,better to let it go Because\Nif you ruin my event,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.20,0:03:39.49,Default,,0,0,0,,you're gonna be sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.68,0:03:42.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Take me down to the perilous. Screw you!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.44,0:03:44.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Olé.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.50,0:03:45.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep it coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.04,0:03:46.87,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.95,0:03:48.28,Default,,0,0,0,,You think this is a bullfart?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.48,0:04:05.34,Default,,0,0,0,,It may ripple like an ordinary cape,\Nbut this is made of solid steel.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.70,0:04:08.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I ate the ripple ripple\Nfruit and became a flag man.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.92,0:04:12.56,Default,,0,0,0,,You see, all it takes is\None touch, and I can make
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.64,0:04:15.58,Default,,0,0,0,,anything even my own\Nbody flutter like a flag.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.50,0:04:18.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Lock.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.82,0:04:22.12,Default,,0,0,0,,This is corridor Kalifa.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.82,0:04:32.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.73,0:04:34.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Get moving, if I were you gentlemen!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.66,0:04:47.38,Default,,0,0,0,,They love the smell of blood, they're\Nfine-tuned to it you might say.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.88,0:05:04.32,Default,,0,0,0,,It's flying!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.18,0:05:08.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.12,0:05:23.06,Default,,0,0,0,,You get a good look at that?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.42,0:05:25.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Those fighting fish don't hold back!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.20,0:05:32.20,Default,,0,0,0,,They're only supposed to attack\Nonce you fall in the water.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.28,0:05:35.40,Default,,0,0,0,,But these guys are rule-breakers. Why,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.48,0:05:40.52,Default,,0,0,0,,the fish in the first round are practically\Nmild matter compared to these savages.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.38,0:05:46.40,Default,,0,0,0,,We handpicked the strongest fighter\Nfrom each school just for this battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.28,0:05:53.02,Default,,0,0,0,,If you look carefully, you'll see that\None of them has a surprise on his back.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.30,0:05:58.18,Default,,0,0,0,,A treasure chest which holds none\Nother than the Flake Flake Roots.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.04,0:06:04.68,Default,,0,0,0,,The rules of the finals\Nare simple. Stay in the
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.76,0:06:07.82,Default,,0,0,0,,ring and take the fruit\Nfrom the back of the fish to
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.90,0:06:14.60,Default,,0,0,0,,claim victory it's finally\Nhere the match you've all
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.68,0:06:17.88,Default,,0,0,0,,been waiting for it'll be\Na five-man battle royale
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.96,0:06:20.98,Default,,0,0,0,,including our hero diamante\Nthey must avoid the
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.06,0:06:24.30,Default,,0,0,0,,wrath of the deadly fighting\Nfish and scramble to snag
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.38,0:06:27.16,Default,,0,0,0,,The treasure. Who among\Nthese fighters will lay
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.24,0:06:32.30,Default,,0,0,0,,claim to the flame flame\Nfruit and now let the battle
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.22,0:06:34.05,Default,,0,0,0,,begin
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.94,0:06:49.56,Default,,0,0,0,,nice let's go
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.80,0:06:55.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that how you get inside the palace?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.00,0:06:57.74,Default,,0,0,0,,The palace is above us.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.30,0:06:59.84,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the Rampart Tower.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.54,0:07:03.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Thankfully, the Rampart\NTower has a secret entrance.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.46,0:07:06.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go, but take care not\Nto let the guards notice you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.58,0:07:10.26,Default,,0,0,0,,They'll call the executives\Nif we make a scene.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.34,0:07:11.46,Default,,0,0,0,,That won't be good.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.28,0:07:14.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Especially if we have to battle with Pika.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.62,0:07:16.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Then any hope of success would be lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.62,0:07:20.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Where is Sir Luffy?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.04,0:07:22.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh-oh, right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.98,0:07:33.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, what's up with that hoop?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.16,0:07:36.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, Gum-Gum!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.50,0:07:44.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe it's actually a\Nblue fish? That's freaky!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.42,0:07:45.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Giant pitfall!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.54,0:07:57.98,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell is he doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.74,0:08:05.68,Default,,0,0,0,,It's open.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.02,0:08:07.88,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not the issue here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.08,0:08:09.22,Default,,0,0,0,,This is not good.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.72,0:08:12.26,Default,,0,0,0,,You get lucky. Well, new plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.50,0:08:13.38,Default,,0,0,0,,We're going in.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.60,0:08:15.48,Default,,0,0,0,,If we hurry, we might get lucky.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.76,0:08:17.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Can I take this thing off now?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.20,0:08:20.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Not like I could stop you. Now, now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.48,0:08:23.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Straw Hat?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.84,0:08:31.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat Luffy has broken in!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.40,0:08:41.36,Default,,0,0,0,,The fighting fish attacks, but\NLucy leaps aside with ease!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.72,0:08:43.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobody else has moves like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.02,0:08:49.10,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell is going on here?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.82,0:08:52.36,Default,,0,0,0,,You're sure it was Straw Hat Luffy? Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.62,0:08:54.44,Default,,0,0,0,,He smashed the gate in with one punch!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.52,0:08:56.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I think you should get your eyes checked.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.58,0:08:58.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat's fighting in the Coliseum.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.66,0:09:00.66,Default,,0,0,0,,He's in disguise, but it's sloppy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.92,0:09:08.74,Default,,0,0,0,,This is from our tower. Me too,\Nin front of the main dining hall!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.22,0:09:10.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm confusing myself!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.46,0:09:12.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat Luffy is from the intruders!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.12,0:09:19.64,Default,,0,0,0,,He's with pirate hunter Sauron.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.72,0:09:22.50,Default,,0,0,0,,And wait, Lady Violet!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.36,0:09:29.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat Luffy broke into the tower.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.58,0:09:33.88,Default,,0,0,0,,And who the hell is that idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.96,0:09:37.06,Default,,0,0,0,,With this stupid disguise\Nfighting in the Coliseum!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.14,0:09:39.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Can somebody tell me what's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.70,0:10:11.50,Default,,0,0,0,,You bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.78,0:10:14.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Come now!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.28,0:10:18.96,Default,,0,0,0,,He's too fast for me to see.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.86,0:10:22.60,Default,,0,0,0,,You hopeless little fools.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.84,0:10:24.66,Default,,0,0,0,,This old man too quick for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.36,0:10:27.90,Default,,0,0,0,,If you must know, I'll clue you in.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.98,0:10:31.27,Default,,0,0,0,,We really didn't expect any\Nexecutives to take the lift.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.92,0:10:36.34,Default,,0,0,0,,When I received an order to protect\Nthe entrance to the toy house,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.42,0:10:37.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I got a little mixed up.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.12,0:10:40.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I accidentally rode the\Nlift all the way down.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.94,0:10:44.42,Default,,0,0,0,,So I waited at the trade port floor\Nuntil I could ride it up again.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.50,0:10:46.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Took a bit, but I got back on.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.66,0:10:50.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I'm here taking it to\Nget back to the ground floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.68,0:10:51.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Floor G!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.44,0:10:57.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't let you anywhere near\Nthe palace, infiltrators.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.48,0:10:59.31,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.39,0:11:00.54,Default,,0,0,0,,We won't be stopped.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.00,0:11:06.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat Luffy is currently\Nat B1 of the Rampart Tower.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.72,0:11:10.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Which way? The left.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.82,0:11:11.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm coming, Mingo.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.04,0:11:12.98,Default,,0,0,0,,The coast is clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.06,0:11:14.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess security can't keep up.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.38,0:11:25.38,Default,,0,0,0,,It's huge!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.98,0:11:33.24,Default,,0,0,0,,A wall monster! Not quite. It's Pika!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.10,0:11:36.12,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a dude?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.40,0:11:37.34,Default,,0,0,0,,What's his deal?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.56,0:11:38.80,Default,,0,0,0,,He's a top executive.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.08,0:11:40.48,Default,,0,0,0,,A stone assimilation man.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.56,0:11:42.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Great, and we get to deal with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.10,0:11:43.28,Default,,0,0,0,,He's a power holder.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.46,0:11:45.16,Default,,0,0,0,,He ate the stone stone fruit.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.24,0:11:46.07,Default,,0,0,0,,You see?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.15,0:11:47.66,Default,,0,0,0,,So he controls the walls?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.56,0:11:52.12,Default,,0,0,0,,So, he's not just a guy made of bricks.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.56,0:11:56.12,Default,,0,0,0,,He can merge with stone\Nitself and control it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.38,0:11:58.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Then it becomes his own body.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.28,0:12:02.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Which means the palace\Nitself has become our enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.88,0:12:17.08,Default,,0,0,0,,the walls.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.28,0:12:32.66,Default,,0,0,0,,and another ruthless\Nfighting fish wants in.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.74,0:12:34.46,Default,,0,0,0,,oh it's on now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.68,0:12:39.82,Default,,0,0,0,,did that bloodthirsty\Nfish catch him off guard?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.02,0:12:43.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, fishy!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.52,0:12:46.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Shockwave!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.82,0:12:47.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Alma!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.28,0:12:54.36,Default,,0,0,0,,The whole Coliseum is feeling that one!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.18,0:12:57.58,Default,,0,0,0,,That was the massive hole in the sand!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.04,0:13:00.38,Default,,0,0,0,,His special move, the\Nshockwave in the boat,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.46,0:13:03.23,Default,,0,0,0,,certainly leaves us all\Nwaking up in our boots!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.60,0:13:09.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Hailing from the Blackbeard Pirate Crew,\Nhe's one of their ten titanic captains.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.70,0:13:12.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Jesus Burgess has just shown us firsthand.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.58,0:13:14.90,Default,,0,0,0,,he's truly a force of nature!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.02,0:13:21.04,Default,,0,0,0,,He's dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.84,0:13:30.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like another fighting\Nfish has reared its ugly fin!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.44,0:13:32.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder who he's got his eyes on!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.88,0:13:34.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, take a look at that!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.34,0:13:38.82,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the Fishbox O-1 carrying the\Nmuch-lusted Asperger treasure chest!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.86,0:13:42.04,Default,,0,0,0,,There it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.38,0:13:47.64,Default,,0,0,0,,He's locked under the mail!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.16,0:13:49.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Just kidding!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.52,0:13:51.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Our fish friend has had a change of plans!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.04,0:13:53.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Who is he going for?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.74,0:13:55.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you all seeing this?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.66,0:13:57.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Just who is O-1 targeting?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.62,0:14:01.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, he's going for America!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.88,0:14:06.12,Default,,0,0,0,,It must have been sticking\Nher arm from the gate ago!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.84,0:14:08.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I need to cut the chain at least!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.54,0:14:15.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.45,0:14:17.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got you now! Think again!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.28,0:14:20.16,Default,,0,0,0,,It's mine!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.36,0:14:23.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Here comes the fierce face-off\Nbetween Lucy and Diamante!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.14,0:14:25.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Straw Hats!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.14,0:14:30.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't forget about me!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.78,0:14:34.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll knock you and that fish\Nout in one shot—get ready!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.66,0:14:37.52,Default,,0,0,0,,That flame, flame fruit belongs to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.60,0:14:39.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Ron burgess is prepping the elbow.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.96,0:14:40.79,Default,,0,0,0,,My
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.42,0:14:47.92,Default,,0,0,0,,barrier isn't here to protect\Nyou—not gonna run, lucy!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.00,0:14:49.82,Default,,0,0,0,,run lucy
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.08,0:14:54.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Tuck wave coming up!\NEat this! Dragon claw!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.56,0:15:17.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, all be damned!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.16,0:15:20.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Burgesses of ours have\Nshattered into pieces!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.68,0:15:23.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, badass!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.46,0:15:26.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so proud of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.68,0:15:27.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't want to give me the fruit?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.04,0:15:30.62,Default,,0,0,0,,If that's what you get,\NI'm not gonna lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.84,0:15:33.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Seems like his fighting\Nstyle changed suddenly.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.90,0:15:36.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Did Straw Hat swap with somebody else?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.76,0:15:48.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Toys are coming out one after the other.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.26,0:15:49.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Sugar is making them.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.82,0:15:50.72,Default,,0,0,0,,We were right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.08,0:15:52.28,Default,,0,0,0,,She's in the tower.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.14,0:15:55.49,Default,,0,0,0,,What are those tentacle things up there?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.64,0:16:00.11,Default,,0,0,0,,There's an exclusive lift for\Nthe executives in the middle.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.18,0:16:05.89,Default,,0,0,0,,But those pipes on the sides are where\Nbig people and broken toys get tossed in.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.88,0:16:13.30,Default,,0,0,0,,They all lead here, but those giant chutes\Ncan be found everywhere in Dressrosa.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.58,0:16:15.24,Default,,0,0,0,,When someone falls through one,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.32,0:16:19.67,Default,,0,0,0,,they'll drop past us and streak to a\Nscrap heap below the executive tower.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.52,0:16:25.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Revolting.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.43,0:16:27.91,Default,,0,0,0,,First I'm thrown into\Nthe garbage and now this?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.00,0:16:29.98,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems I've fallen into a trap.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.26,0:16:32.18,Default,,0,0,0,,And a slimy one, unfortunately.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.70,0:16:35.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Should have known something was amiss\Nwhen they took me to the medical room.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.40,0:16:37.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I wasn't even hurt, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.92,0:16:41.04,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not slangy. Big silly. It's sticky.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.86,0:16:43.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa! Hello!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.40,0:16:44.52,Default,,0,0,0,,What is this place?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.28,0:16:48.12,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the executive tower.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.54,0:16:52.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Also, it's where toys come from,\Nthough outsiders wouldn't understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.68,0:16:55.92,Default,,0,0,0,,But since you're here, you're\Nnot really an outsider, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.00,0:17:00.35,Default,,0,0,0,,So we might as well tell you the other\Nname we have for this special room.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.98,0:17:01.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Sugar!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.89,0:17:02.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell him for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.34,0:17:04.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't care.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.30,0:17:08.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.21,0:17:09.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Look what you did.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.42,0:17:11.00,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a double snot rope.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.66,0:17:13.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Just die. You're gross.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.84,0:17:15.24,Default,,0,0,0,,No, you die.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.64,0:17:19.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, but I don't take orders\Nfrom little brats like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.18,0:17:22.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you help me, kid? I'm stuck.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.70,0:17:24.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Gotta get this sticky goo off of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.98,0:17:30.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Here's your contract.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.92,0:17:33.48,Default,,0,0,0,,You will not do harm to any human.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.56,0:17:36.50,Default,,0,0,0,,And you will follow all\Norders from the family.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.58,0:17:42.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm confused, and wait—what\Nhappened to my body?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.20,0:17:43.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Changed me back.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.68,0:17:45.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop talking and get to work.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.80,0:17:49.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, I can't talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.90,0:17:51.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Why am I obeying this idiot?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.02,0:17:54.88,Default,,0,0,0,,And you will follow all\Norders from the family.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.96,0:17:59.74,Default,,0,0,0,,The contract—one more thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.82,0:18:01.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobody remembers you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.12,0:18:02.12,Default,,0,0,0,,remembers you
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.32,0:18:05.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Even I forgot who you were a second ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.46,0:18:08.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Now you're going to work for Dofie until
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.48,0:18:11.24,Default,,0,0,0,,you break down and we\Nhave to throw you away.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.84,0:18:15.20,Default,,0,0,0,,How is this happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.46,0:18:17.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm some kind of toy slave.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.44,0:18:21.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep walking straight till you\Nhit the port, then get to work.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.32,0:18:24.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, new guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.88,0:18:26.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll show you where to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.46,0:18:27.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this a port?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.78,0:18:29.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.98,0:18:32.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Here, now get to work
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.90,0:18:39.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a pirate, dammit. What\Nkind of nightmare is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.18,0:18:40.42,Default,,0,0,0,,And how do I wake up?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.38,0:18:42.68,Default,,0,0,0,,There, your box.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.76,0:18:43.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Now go.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.36,0:18:46.36,Default,,0,0,0,,No, these toys are creepy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.44,0:18:47.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want to be one of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.98,0:18:51.16,Default,,0,0,0,,And I especially don't want\Nto slave away until I die.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.42,0:18:58.00,Default,,0,0,0,,So this is where they trade the\Nweapons to the warring nations.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.08,0:18:59.86,Default,,0,0,0,,But I'm powerless to stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.08,0:19:01.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm helping them.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.98,0:19:04.56,Default,,0,0,0,,This is just the lead we were looking for.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.80,0:19:06.98,Default,,0,0,0,,If only I had a transponder snail.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.48,0:19:08.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Koala's waiting for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.00,0:19:11.41,Default,,0,0,0,,There must be some way to regain control.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.78,0:19:13.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Curse you, Doflamingo.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.52,0:19:14.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm the king of protents.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.20,0:19:17.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Work as a toy till I break down?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.58,0:19:18.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that a joke?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.08,0:19:20.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Somebody help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.12,0:19:30.36,Default,,0,0,0,,That must be Sugar talking to Trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.58,0:19:32.82,Default,,0,0,0,,She really is a kid. In appearance.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.54,0:19:35.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, we know she loves grapes.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.98,0:19:37.45,Default,,0,0,0,,She eats them constantly.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.56,0:19:38.80,Default,,0,0,0,,And why do I care?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.04,0:19:39.98,Default,,0,0,0,,We have a plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.58,0:19:42.02,Default,,0,0,0,,And a secret weapon!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.20,0:19:46.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like a grape, but it's\Na clump of Tata Babasco.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.88,0:19:49.08,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the hottest spice in the world!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.44,0:19:52.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on, you're gonna make her eat it?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.14,0:19:55.55,Default,,0,0,0,,We just have to sneak it into the basket.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.98,0:19:59.12,Default,,0,0,0,,We tested it before on\N50 people from our tribe.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.42,0:20:02.95,Default,,0,0,0,,All of them were knocked out\Ncold and 18 of them almost died
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.74,0:20:10.26,Default,,0,0,0,,That sounds bad. It better\Nbe. We can't take any risk.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.86,0:20:13.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, Leo go.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.60,0:20:15.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be watching you from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.60,0:20:20.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I feel stronger already If this\Ngoes south, I'm cutting out.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.24,0:20:23.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Good luck, Leo!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.22,0:20:27.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up! Are you crazy?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.62,0:20:29.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't let Trouble notice you!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.72,0:20:30.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Be careful!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.12,0:20:31.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.03,0:20:32.94,Default,,0,0,0,,They're gonna kill you!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.36,0:20:34.78,Default,,0,0,0,,This is just the start.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.62,0:20:37.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone, prepare yourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.30,0:20:43.44,Default,,0,0,0,,The moment that Sugar screams is the\Nmoment when every toy in the kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.52,0:20:45.84,Default,,0,0,0,,regains their human form at long last.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.72,0:20:50.01,Default,,0,0,0,,And the other citizens will\Nreclaim their lost memories.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.56,0:20:52.76,Default,,0,0,0,,The truth of this land will be revealed.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.84,0:20:57.72,Default,,0,0,0,,All of Doflamingo's evil will\Nbe dragged out into the light!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.22,0:21:01.88,Default,,0,0,0,,We will save our friends\Nand dress Rosa as well!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.48,0:21:04.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.12,0:21:06.18,Default,,0,0,0,,You're too loud!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.40,0:21:09.04,Default,,0,0,0,,King Rick will claim\Nthis kingdom once more!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.72,0:21:12.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Please shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.62,0:21:14.42,Default,,0,0,0,,They're gonna hear you!
